      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE CHANELLE (2) finished in the minors last start over the 400m at this track but ran a handy 22.93 last start. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. REBORN PASSION (4) hit the frame latest (22.83) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. Among the main chances. FASCINATE VERN (1) was in the minors two back (22.42) at Gosford but ran below best last time there, finishing 7th. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BOY NAMED BLUE (3) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
